# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.local.example
*.json.key
adb-research-*.json

# --- Source caches ----------------------------------------------------------
# Every program has its own .cache/ for upstream-fetched source data.
# These are public-source reproducible via the program's scripts/ — see the
# README.md inside each .cache/ for the regenerate path. They are git-ignored
# because (a) some are very large (Open Buildings tiles ~4.6 GB, PSA/NAMRIA
# .gdb 807 MB, BGD road .gpkg 310 MB, BGD public-facility JSON pages ~2.5 GB)
# and (b) git is not the right artifact store for binary mirrors of public
# data. Reproducibility per CONSTITUTION.md §11 is preserved via the
# fetch scripts + manifest.sha256 hashes; a reviewer rehydrates the cache
# from public sources by running the scripts.
**/.cache/*
!**/.cache/README.md

# --- Generated artifacts that are reproducible ------------------------------
# Build outputs that re-emerge from npm install / npm run build / quarto
# render. Source-of-record for each is checked in (markdown source for
# slides, React source for the site, Python sources for charts).
node_modules/
.next/
**/.next/
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
reporting-site/dist/
reporting-site/dev-server.*.log
reporting-site/.playwright-mcp/
reporting-site/*.png
reporting-site/*.jpg
reporting-site/*.jpeg
.playwright-mcp/
psdq-spatial-desktop.jpg
psdq-spatial-section-desktop.png
psdq-evidence-mobile-after-fix.png
psdq-program-desktop.png
psdq-poverty-panel.png
psdq-poverty-panel-mobile.png
psdq-source-check.png
luminosity-gap/.next/
luminosity-gap/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

